{"sha": "b8ed0a2f998ced33aaff7cbf8e70ee31c5465871c6b045dc502027b215363a09", "body": ["{\\small 左图：可逆变化，双箭头表示它们可以", "双向进行。右图：化学变化，只能单向进行。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{出现新物质的线索}", "", "\\begin{method}[是化学变化吗？寻找线索]\\label{met:g5:irreversible-changes:clues}", "出现新物质时，往往有以下线索之一：", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 出现新的\\textbf{颜色}（烤面包片变成的褐色）；", "  \\item 未经加热，液体中出现气体的", "        \\textbf{气泡}（醋倒在小苏打上）；", "  \\item 出现新的\\textbf{气味}（变酸的牛奶、烤焦的面包）；", "  \\item 放出\\textbf{热量或光}（燃烧的蜡烛）；", "  \\item 澄清的液体中\\textbf{出现固体}，或", "        形成块状物（牛奶凝结）。", "\\end{enumerate}", "仅凭一条线索可能导致误判：水沸腾时冒泡，但", "并未生成新物质 --- 冒出的是水的蒸气，", "蒸气冷却后水又会回来。多找几条线索，并问一问：能否复原？", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small]", "  \\foreach \\k/\\t in {0/{new colour}, 1/{gas bubbles}, 2/{new smell},", "                     3/{heat or light}, 4/{a solid appears}} {", "    \\begin{scope}[xshift=\\k*3.2cm]", "      \\draw[omProp, line width=0.8pt, fill=omProp!5] (0,0) circle (1.0);", "      \\node[anchor=north, align=center] at (0,-1.15) {\\t};", "    \\end{scope}", "  }", "  % 1: colour, a slice of toast half brown", "  \\fill[yellow!20, draw=brown!60] (-0.55,-0.5) rectangle (0.55,0.55);", "  \\fill[brown!55] (0,-0.5) rectangle (0.55,0.55);", "  % 2: bubbles in a beaker", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=3.2cm]", "    \\pic[transform shape, scale=0.45] at (0,-0.55) {beaker={0.7}{omWater!80}};", "    \\foreach \\x/\\y in {-0.15/-0.2,0.1/0.05,-0.05/0.25,0.18/-0.35,-0.2/0.15}", "      \\draw[black!55] (\\x,\\y) circle (0.05);", "  \\end{scope}", "  % 3: smell, wavy lines", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=6.4cm]", "    \\foreach \\x in {-0.35,0,0.35} \\draw[black!55, line width=0.8pt, decorate,", "      decoration={snake, amplitude=1.5pt, segment length=6pt}] (\\x,-0.6) -- (\\x,0.6);", "  \\end{scope}", "  % 4: a flame", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=9.6cm]", "    \\fill[orange!80] (0,-0.6) .. controls (-0.45,-0.05) and (-0.15,0.35) .. (0,0.7)", "      .. controls (0.15,0.35) and (0.45,-0.05) .. (0,-0.6);", "    \\fill[yellow!80] (0,-0.45) .. controls (-0.2,-0.1) and (-0.08,0.15) .. (0,0.3)", "      .. controls (0.08,0.15) and (0.2,-0.1) .. (0,-0.45);", "  \\end{scope}", "  % 5: solid settling in a test tube", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=12.8cm]", "    \\pic[transform shape, scale=0.4] at (0,-0.65) {testtube={0.75}{omWater!80}};", "    \\fill[white, draw=black!40] (-0.08,-0.62) rectangle (0.08,-0.5);", "    \\foreach \\x/\\y in {-0.04/-0.3,0.04/-0.1,0/0.1} \\fill[black!35] (\\x,\\y) circle (0.03);", "  \\end{scope}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 化学变化可能发生的五条线索。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{inthelab}[醋与小苏打]", "老师取一勺白色粉末状的小苏打，放在", "烧杯底部，再倒入一些醋。混合物立即嘶嘶作响、冒出泡沫：", "放出了气体，这是化学变化的线索。嘶嘶声停止后，", "小苏打已经消失，", "无法通过干燥将其复原。", "\\end{inthelab}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\includegraphics[width=0.5\\linewidth]{images/book1/ai/g5-baking-soda-lab.jpg}", "", "{\\small 醋与小苏打反应：放出气体。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{有利和有害的变化}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[身边的化学变化]\\label{prop:g5:irreversible-changes:around}", "许多化学变化是有益的：烹饪食物、烘焙面包、", "燃烧燃气为房屋供暖，石膏或水泥凝固变硬。另一些则造成损害：", "铁生锈、食物变质、木材腐烂。这些变化无法逆转，", "但可以减缓它们的进程：", "\\begin{itemize}", "  \\item 食物放在冰箱的低温中可以保存更久；", "  \\item 油漆或一层油膜可以隔绝空气和水，保护铁；", "  \\item 切开的苹果撒上柠檬汁，变褐色的速度更慢。", "\\end{itemize}", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\includegraphics[width=0.55\\linewidth]{images/book1/ai/g5-rusty-bicycle.jpg}", "", "{\\small 一辆自行车长年露天放置在雨中：铁已经生锈。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{remark}[无法逆转，但并不简单]\\label{rem:g5:irreversible-changes:not-simply}", "“无法逆转”是指没有简单的办法可以回到原状，", "例如冷却或干燥。化学家有时可以把铁锈变回铁，", "但需要借助熔炉和新的物质：这仍然是另一个化学变化，", "而不是简单地逆转。", "\\end{remark}", "", "\\section{练习}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g5:irreversible-changes:1}", "判断下列各变化是否可以逆转：熔化巧克力、燃烧", "火柴、盐溶于水、烤面包。", "\\end{exercise}", ""]}